+def apply_shipping_method_snapshot(
+    order: models.Order, method_data: ShippingMethodData
+) -> ShippingMethodData:
+    """Overwrite the delivery-method metadata with the order snapshot.
+
+    AC-24-5: the delivery information reported for an order (including in event
+    payloads) must come from the snapshot captured when the order was created,
+    not from the source delivery method, which may have changed since.
+    Orders without a captured snapshot (e.g. created before the feature, or via
+    paths that do not write one) keep reporting the source method's metadata.
